      "value": "<p>Requires a free hand and a bonus action to turn on or off. When activated, this flashlight casts brightlight in a 60-foot cone and dim light for an additional 60 feet. Alternatively, you can use the low-light setting, shining bright light in a 30-foot cone and dim light for an additional 30 feet. A flashlight battery lasts 24 hours.</p>",
